<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:f9a94b2617197a1fa28aefa8f2a2d74d24ff9461> <http://schema.org/description> "Data collected from stakeholders within the Southeast of England region (Balanced Seas region), by Balanced Seas project team between January 2010 and October 2010. Interview home port data was processed to create a gridded 1km by 1km map of home port frequency." .
