_:e92e2b45043973a941bc62abdee3891c <http://schema.org/value> "Queens Wharf" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2e626fd5258a0ecf2c4cb063e0f850fb887a3c2> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:f9f42ead49af0d079e107d7f07eaba0b .
_:d08a42379c2ec9262ec8861dd3dfa8b4 <http://schema.org/value> "UK" .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2e626fd5258a0ecf2c4cb063e0f850fb887a3c2> <http://schema.org/description> "The purpose of this report is to give an overview of the characteristics of the coastal environment in areas where\r\nmarine aggregate dredging takes place, or is likely to occur in the future. We then highlight how the results of\r\nmajor investment in research carried out in the UK over the past decade, particularly through the Aggregate Levy\r\nSustainability Fund (ALSF), have assisted in our understanding of the nature and scale of impacts of dredging on\r\nthe marine environment, and how this information has been used to improve the sustainable management of\r\nthis key resource for the UK economy." .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2e626fd5258a0ecf2c4cb063e0f850fb887a3c2> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:d08a42379c2ec9262ec8861dd3dfa8b4 .
