<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2bc309963c36cd124795e8a798fcce821aeea55> <http://schema.org/additionalProperty> _:ff343d6dee5e952053fa3da551e47ebb .
<urn:gleaner.io:oih:medin:data:b2bc309963c36cd124795e8a798fcce821aeea55> <http://schema.org/description> "Bioblitz survey which took place in Northam Burrows. This survey's aim was to record as many species as possible as being present within a set survey area over 8-hours. A variety of different methods were employed, including plankton netting and walkovers although most records were ad-hoc sightings made during the 8 hour survey." .
